[stderr] -2. If that exclusion leaves fewer cards than requested, retain the full
[stderr] -   eligible pool and set `reuseDisclosure = true`; the round explicitly says
[stderr] -   that familiar cards may appear because the theme has too few alternatives.
[stderr] -3. Rank the selected pool by ascending `rankToken` from the recorded fixture
[stderr] -   seed. Tie-break with ascending stable card ID. Take the first requested
[stderr] -   number, then store the eligibility snapshot, seed, rank tokens, ledger
[stderr] -   round IDs, selection, and disclosure flag in the round record.
[stderr] +### Eight seeded selection fixtures
[stderr]  
