[stderr] -## Editorial release checks
[stderr] +## Release checks
[stderr]  
[stderr] -Before publishing a batch or revision, validate all twenty `ADJ-1` fixtures,
[stderr] -the eight `SEL-1` fixtures, non-empty provenance/review event references,
[stderr] -distinct reviewer identities, current revision alignment, alias collision
[stderr] -rules, and the lifecycle replay. Any failure blocks publication; it cannot be
[stderr] -waived by a runtime answer guess or selector fallback.
[stderr] +Eligibility requires published frozen-snapshot state, correct answer rule, no
[stderr] +alias collision, current provenance, two distinct accepted reviews, and no
[stderr] +effective withdrawal. The fixture suite requires exactly ADJ-01–ADJ-20 and
[stderr] +SEL-01–SEL-08. Failed validation blocks release; it cannot create a fallback
[stderr] +answer or undisclosed repeat.
